                    <note type="editorial">
                        <p>see Ed Pope's notes: PCC wills 1800 Stephen Day laceman Covt Gdn wife
                            Lydia / gent of Kensington 1823 / Samuel Day gent of St Clement Danes
                            1802 of New Inn all to Sarah Woodward widow (Saml Day attorney 7 New Inn
                            1799 Law List) / Starling Day merchant Norwich 1815 jr, 1820 sr.
                            </p><p>We agree that this is likely to be a different day from the man
                            who appears in 1813 and 14. There's a question as to whether the 1799
                            entries are for the same person as those in 1802 and 1804,but we have
                            coded them as such.</p>
